    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0f1e85660fa8f8111ff317",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，记者们却称她为丸善斯基的\n“接班人”或是“二世”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f68cb68409c9c69b2744d1f926fbe1fc3f4daf2138f25e2c3e2fa4fcf4c0996",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef5be9b2d44b0a987671128c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞像是想煽动记者们的情绪般，\n宣告将参加丸善斯基在过去\n创下新纪录的“朝日杯FS”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d9c990cb081de5dcf586306eb87125d3f4cfc6ca3f841da2369872885bfb7fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de8e2caa7f4600d31c9c873",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・背水之阵",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aab3eda017bbabf8cfaa2369aef75fb24d28bf46c8ffc2dc4df3f465ea6a2c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:743c5cb6be0037f5e5ffb278",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞顺利跑完了比赛。\n然而，即使她获得了无数的喝彩，\n也没有摆脱丸善斯基接班人这个标签。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60347cff17e8d8a9deb761c6909bd9ac9842bd6e55d6340c4382651a032a6598",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43b4cf326bb6f05d6c11c33d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她为了摆脱“接班人”之名，\n立下了与丸善斯基\n正面对决的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3cc5119ec761c9d799f8231d6336e37233dec3912167fb4b4e59be449b8680",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8074010aaa193be624e623",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了实现这个目标，\n草上飞必须参加经典赛累积经验……\n于是她决定先参加“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37fdd7807a711cf225b0fe0b7111184bc9d8b33f548e2ecea40773f578e87018",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:defa2c962ddb10e38617ec0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "朝日杯FS结束后・不挠",
      "source_fingerprint": "e14bb9d71b85bab7761a96b9fb4bfdfe8009bf1eb8c915d37c154f898d9fc146",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae3ccc3516ff7f7b1fb7d794",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞以压倒性的实力\n称霸了“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e1055e59b5ef3cd82b9a6cd12b22326ee52b62d21a02259c9c20f5ce6339f89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a4e621059fcfcdd27618a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后，\n神鹰似乎无法接受结果，\n因此前来要求在“日本杯”再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "650c1c55b9c37b30d0ca33158881e538145869b2a803ff3434c89f9bdefbf012",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac7a1dfda6d696d5a5739d36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞原本并没有打算参加日本杯，\n因此陷入烦恼。就在此时，\n丸善斯基突然出现在她的面前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "880c6cb637220470d2e7dec4c78448ed4553c47e2b76e7d745fc2b67456d1fb3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d24eb9ac4e5526953d2befdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她像是在挑衅草上飞般，\n留下“或许神鹰才是‘怪物二世’”这句话，\n便离开了现场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64c2a403c36d0b16c915dba2317677cc47741c68d7693f76147db6fe563cf037",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ef07cc24ea7de84e608ca74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞听了这句话之后不再犹豫，\n决定与神鹰一决胜负。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa61878724784f2bae1c6d5b3f1aa19c0a953aa1576d92ce74c16e5fc4d47d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1011/storytimeline_501011417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8807b26428c110cd6cdcb10b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比结束后・燃起火焰",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f56cad99a8379e4c61b6caaee6e4e234aecebbdd9790596b2314ff6beda4b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
