      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后，\n青云天空来到草上飞面前向她说\n“不被你看在眼里感觉很难受”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "277293e8d1b827b8a892b4c3a137e70480789f566fc85fedb806fa7befdab7ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
