      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这句话让草上飞意识到，\n自己并没有全心全意地\n投入这场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fa4963986b76453ee8e19d9813e2c761d8c34c0806a04cfe970f869bc5f5ed9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
