      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她失落地表示，\n这样的自己无法赢过\n没有参赛的丸善斯基。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37aa5190b9e60dc4b3f77c133522357d68f871e584e50ba30418dd685bb06cfe",
