      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后，\n青云天空来到草上飞面前向她说\n“你今天破绽百出”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6986e254b0a523d03089102350776c27edf17462ae50f5e7652369deaebc274",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
