      "uid": "zhcn:68109c3ab3a41931dc2c436f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "许多观众被她的表现深深吸引，\n对下一场比赛寄予期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0b5bd29ef401719461ca6b0773ffd9ec17ef3b70fd192f3401590c9418ec79",
