      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后，\n神鹰再次前来，\n向草上飞下了不知道是第几次的战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83f279e9087b5a7f65c3acea3f3198f88ae02baa85955513b4ca0a93e9de0dd4",
