      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们一决胜负的舞台是\n无声铃鹿也会参赛的“每日王冠”……\n感觉会是一场竞争激烈的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1436727935b606605b6df1434851dcb07dc8d7a2513f169767db6ebce26c4a28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
