      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "草上飞输给了特别周。\n不过，她小声地说\n自己对这个结果并不后悔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15689d52351e8e5362c5a32bff12c05ef437eee783da678b874fdb6467dbef74",
