      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着她再次向我提出请求，\n希望能够参加一年前自己表现不佳的\n“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8fbb18038d6e6cdf2102814594b4aa12644cb6fb4184af1b0a480cd1f2de9aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
