      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周看完三人竞争激烈的比赛之后\n一句话也说不出来。\n这时，丸善斯基向她搭了话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c3075945eb12330efa31c7ceff5cab60b62245813cc5c8832d386f692d7e20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
